          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " poured over at the last moment is the point of the dish. Speed matters: serve within 2 minutes of assembling or the bread will lose its crunch."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tip: toast the cashews in a dry pan just before assembling. Warm nuts release more flavour than cold ones."
          }
        ]
